[0.210, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mAre you using a screen reader to play this story?\r\u001b[3d\u001b(B\u001b[m(The choices are\r\u001b[4d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mY\u001b(B\u001b[m for \"Yes\", or\r\u001b[5d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mN\u001b(B\u001b[m for \"No\".)\r\u001b[7d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mType in your choice here:\u001b[C\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
[1.293, "o", "\u001b[?25l"]
