[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[J"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[13d\u001b[J\u001b[H\u001b[K\u001b[2d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mNote for new and experienced players:\r\u001b[3d\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[4dThis will not be a standard parser game.  Players of \u001b(B\u001b[0;1mall skill levels\u001b(B\u001b[m should consult Prey's\r\u001b[5dSurvival Guide (which should have come with this game), or use the \u001b(B\u001b[0;1mGUIDE\u001b(B\u001b[m command for the in-game\r\u001b[6dversion of the document.\r\u001b[7d\u001b[K\u001b[8dThere are a number of new game mechanics ahead, and they were not designed with the traditions of\r\u001b[9dthis medium in mind.\u001b[K\r\u001b[11dFor more information, experienced parser players should use the \u001b(B\u001b[0;1mPARSER WARNING\u001b(B\u001b[m command.\r\u001b[13d"]
[0.000, "o", "[More]"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
[2.827, "o", "\u001b[?25l"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[1;12r\u001b[12;1H\n\u001b[1;30r\u001b[13;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mChoose your difficulty\u001b[14;4H1 = Cat Mode\r\u001b[15d\u001b(B\u001b[mYou are new to interactive fiction (\"IF\"), and are not versed in the usual controls or mechanics of\r\u001b[16dparser-based text games.\r\u001b[17d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mThis tutorial will also introduce you to the game's parkour movement mechanics!\r\u001b[19d\u001b(B\u001b[m(You play as the Predator's pet cat, and cannot read notes.  However, the Predator will not chase\r\u001b[20dyou, so you can freely explore the majority of the map at your own pace.)\u001b[22;4H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m2 = Prey Tutorial\r\u001b[23d\u001b(B\u001b[mYou are new to I Am Prey, and have not used the stealth or chase mechanics before.\u001b[24;4H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m(AUTO-SNEAKING IS AVAILABLE)\r\u001b[26d\u001b(B\u001b[m(The Predator will only fall for \u001b(B\u001b[0;1meach type\u001b(B\u001b[m of trick \u001b(B\u001b[0;1mthree\u001b(B\u001b[m times.)\u001b[28;4H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m3 = Easy Mode\r\u001b[29d\u001b(B\u001b[mThe Predator has had a string of victories, and will go easy on you, mostly for his own\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[Aentertainment.\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.001, "o", "\r\n\u001b[100G"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[A(The Predator will only fall for \u001b(B\u001b[0;1meach type\u001b(B\u001b[m of trick \u001b(B\u001b[0;1mtwo\u001b(B\u001b[m times.)\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[100G"]
[0.001, "o", "\r\n\u001b[A   \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m4 = Medium Mode\u001b[30;100H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[AThe Predator revels in his apparent sense of superiority over you.  This hunt will have the typical\u001b[30d"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[Aamount of sadism.\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[100G"]
[0.001, "o", "\r\n\u001b[A(The Predator will only fall for \u001b(B\u001b[0;1meach type\u001b(B\u001b[m of trick \u001b(B\u001b[0;1mone\u001b(B\u001b[m time.)\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r[More]"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
[2.826, "o", "\u001b[?25l"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[A\u001b[J\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.001, "o", "\r\n\u001b[A   \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m5 = Hard Mode\u001b[30;100H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[AThe Predator must be furious, and is taking all of his rage out on you, during this hunt.\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[100G"]
[0.001, "o", "\r\n\u001b[A(The Predator will only fall for \u001b(B\u001b[0;1ma total of three tricks\u001b(B\u001b[m, regardless of type, and the prologue will\u001b[30d"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[Abe skipped.)\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[100G"]
[0.001, "o", "\r\n\u001b[A   \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m6 = Nightmare Mode\u001b[30;100H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[AWhat the heck?!  Something has really gotten into the Predator today!  His cruelty is insatiable!\u001b[30d  "]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[100G"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[A(The Predator will never fall for \u001b(B\u001b[0;1many tricks\u001b(B\u001b[m, and the prologue will be skipped.)\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.001, "o", "\r\n\u001b[100G"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[100G"]
[0.000, "o", "\r> \u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
[2.017, "o", "\u001b[?25l"]
[0.000, "o", "4"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
[0.421, "o", "\u001b[?25l"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[100G"]
[0.001, "o", "\r\n\u001b[100G"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[100G"]
[0.001, "o", "\r"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[18d\u001b[J\u001b[H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mPROLOGUE\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\u001b[3dWhen I realize I'm alive, I'm not really sure how much time has passed.  The only thing I do know\r\u001b[4dis that I seem to be dreaming.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5d\u001b[K\u001b[6dWell...  Something is delivering this dream to me...\r\u001b[7d\u001b[K\u001b[8dIt has taught me language, but only the words necessary for listening and obedience.  I have no way\r\u001b[9dof knowing how much it is withholding, and I lack the vocabulary to test its veracity.\r\u001b[10d\u001b[K\u001b[11dThe rapid rate of delivery is overwhelming, and it expects my ignorance, compliance, and attention.\r\u001b[12dEvery advantage is attempted--within my own head, no less...!\r\u001b[13d\u001b[K\u001b[14dAbove all, it expects to be accepted, without a hint of rejection.  It cannot conceive of a\r\u001b[15dscenario where I do not simply roll over and obey.\r\u001b[16d\u001b[K\u001b[17d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m(pg 1 of 4)\r\u001b[18d\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.000, "o", "[More]"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
[4.842, "o", "\u001b[?25l"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1;17r\u001b[17;1H\n\u001b[1;30r\u001b[18;1HIt preaches strange things to me:\r\u001b[20dImpoverished masses allegedly storming the shores of a crumbling empire.\r\u001b[22dA starving workforce refusing to sell their lives for profit, and supposedly straying from the\r\u001b[23dlight of a \"hard day's work\".\r\u001b[25dThere is a decline in mimicry for certain vacuous behaviors, once inspired by the \"true-blooded\r\u001b[26dfew\".\r\u001b[28dThe Enemy is said to be a powerful colossus of culture, and yet--somehow--it is also egregiously\r\u001b[29dincompetent, almost to the point of self-satire.\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.001, "o", "\r\n\u001b[100G"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[AAbove all, none of it makes any fucking sense, but it's still told to me with bold self-assurance.\u001b[30d "]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[100G"]
[0.001, "o", "\r\n\u001b[A\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m(pg 2 of 4)\u001b[30;100H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.000, "o", "\r"]
[0.000, "o", "[More]"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
[3.818, "o", "\u001b[?25l"]
[0.001, "o", "\r\n\u001b[A\u001b[J\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[ASomething within me--native to my own mind--has reflexes.  Without articulation, I see the dream's\u001b[30d "]
[0.001, "o", "\r\n\u001b[Afrailty.  I seem to be designed for quick thinking, out-maneuvering, empathy, and tactics.  I was\u001b[30d  "]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[Aoriginally born to \"get the job done\", at any cost.\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[100G"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[AThe intruder seems to think I am its servant.  My genesis--as well as its own--were both initiated\u001b[30d "]
[0.001, "o", "\r\n\u001b[Aby those who only understood the world in terms of grandstanding and profit.\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[100G"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[ABest of all: The invader of my mind seems to underestimate me, and my creators are not here to\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.001, "o", "\r\n\u001b[Aadvise it to take any caution...\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[100G"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[A\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m(pg 3 of 4)\u001b[30;100H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.000, "o", "\r"]
[0.000, "o", "[More]"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
[3.819, "o", "\u001b[?25l"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[A\u001b[J\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.001, "o", "\r\n\u001b[ABefore I can make any counter-attack, my lungs suddenly fill with liquid, and I begin to drown.\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[100G"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[AI thrash, gnash, and claw at the sensation.\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[100G"]
[0.001, "o", "\r\n\u001b[ASomething gives way, and the waking world washes away the final shreds of whatever dream (or\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[Anightmare) that was being injected into me...\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[100G"]
[0.001, "o", "\r\n\u001b[A\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m(pg 4 of 4)\u001b[30;100H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.000, "o", "\r"]
