[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[J\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[30m\u001b[47mThe Delivery Room (in the catch net)\u001b[47X\u001b[1;84H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[30m\u001b[47m0 turns survived\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[37m\u001b[47m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[30m\u001b[47mExits:\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[30m\u001b[47m \u001b[32m\u001b[47meast\u001b[37m\u001b[47m\u001b[K\r\u001b[4d\u001b[39;49m\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m(pg 4 of 4)\r\u001b[6d\u001b(B\u001b[mWELCOME TO...\r\u001b[8d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mI AM PREY\r\u001b[9d\u001b(B\u001b[mversion 0.9.6 BETA (Patch 6)\r\u001b[11dA game of evasion, by Joey Cramsey\r\u001b[13d\"This is based on a recurring nightmare of mine, so now it's your problem, too!\"\r\u001b[15d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mABOUT\u001b(B\u001b[m for a general summary.\r\u001b[16d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mCREDITS\u001b(B\u001b[m for author and tester credits.\r\u001b[17d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mHELP\u001b(B\u001b[m for tutorials and assistance.\r\u001b[20d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mThe Delivery Room (in the catch net)\r\u001b[22dHappy birthday!\u001b(B\u001b[m  I am drenched in a mix of embryonic slime and water!\r\u001b[24dI cough, but it transforms into vomiting, and most of it lands on my own body.  I seem to be\r\u001b[25dcradled in some kind of large, rubbery fishnet mesh, likely designed to catch newborns like me.\r\u001b[27dHuman newborns are tiny, and cry when entering the world.  Clone newborns seem to arrive fully-\r\u001b[28dgrown--if my factory-standard memories are reliable in that regard--and so far I have been a bit\r\u001b[29dtoo delirious to do much of anything.\r\u001b[30d[More]\u001b[2;8H\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
[3.820, "o", "\u001b[?25l"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[29d\u001b[J\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.001, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[29dThe ceiling tiles have been removed here, to make the room taller.  On the west wall, three\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[29dartificial wombs hang on suspended metal frames.  Each has dark cables running into them from an\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[29dopening in the northwest corner of the ceiling.  In the southwest corner, a towel rack, makeup\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[29dvanity, and wardrobe closet have been provided for newborns.\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.001, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[29dI am in the catch net.\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.001, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[29dI can see a stool here.\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[29dIn the wardrobe closet I see an uniform.\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.001, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.003, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[29dThe exit door (east) is closed.\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r>\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
