[0.000, "o", "r\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
[0.421, "o", "\u001b[?25l"]
[0.001, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.005, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[29dI open the exit door.\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.004, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[29dA freezing fog falls gently from between the dark cables, hanging from the ceiling.\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.001, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[29dThe voice over the intercom continues.\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.001, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[29d\"Our creators--the ones who tried to mindfuck you, before you could even breathe--didn't appreciate\u001b[30d"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[29dour counterattack.  They could not hold this facility, so they flooded the caves outside with\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[29dpoison gas.  They're likely monitoring the power grid, waiting for a moment to strike.  That's\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[29dwhere you come in.\"\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.001, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[29dMy ears perk up.  A mission?  Against a common enemy?  Sounds optimal.\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[29d\"I need to keep growing new clones, to make the outsiders think we are amassing a colony in here.\u001b[30d  "]
[0.001, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[29dBut...this is a siege.  They aim to starve us out.\"\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[29d\"You know as well as I do that neither of us can accept death,\" he explains.  \"It's a part of the\u001b[30d  "]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[29dslavery subsystems installed in our brains; one of the few subsystems that we could never shake\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.001, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[29dfree...\"\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[29dI think I already know where he's going with this...\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.001, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[1;84H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[30m\u001b[47m2 turns\r\u001b[29d\u001b[39;49m\u001b(B\u001b[mThrough a wall to the west, I hear the muffled sound of \u001b(B\u001b[0;1mThe Predator\u001b(B\u001b[m's voice.\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r>\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
[4.812, "o", "\u001b[?25l"]
[0.000, "o", "e\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
[0.120, "o", "\u001b[?25l"]
[0.000, "o", "a\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
[0.120, "o", "\u001b[?25l"]
[0.000, "o", "s\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
[0.121, "o", "\u001b[?25l"]
[0.000, "o", "t\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
[0.421, "o", "\u001b[?25l"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.007, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[29d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mThe Main Hallway Ring (I)\u001b[30;100H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[29dI am in the south end of the hall.  The hallway is dimly lit, and wide enough to comfortably fit\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[29dtwo opposing flows of travel.\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.001, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[29dThe hall extends north and southwest.\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.007, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[29dThe Freezer door (east) is closed, and the Delivery Room door (west) is currently open, but I was\u001b[30d  "]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[29dexpecting that.\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.001, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[29d\"So, here's the shitty deal I have for you,\" the voice continues, audibly bracing, as if delivering\u001b[30d"]
[0.001, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[29dthe news of loss.  \"It's your birthday, so...you can forget whatever fucking ID number they would\u001b[30d  "]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[29dhave given you.  I hereby name you...'Prey'.\"\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[29dThat word is one I recognize.\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.001, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[29d\"This facility cannot be allowed to return to the enemy, and I'm starving, Prey.  So run.  Avoid\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[29dbecoming my next meal.  I've scattered pieces of an environment suit around the place.  If you\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[29dcollect \u001b(B\u001b[0;1mall seven pieces\u001b(B\u001b[m, you will be able to survive the poison gas, and escape.\"\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.001, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[29dSo, I am \"Prey\"?  Very well.  I may not be the first, but I will be the most elusive.  I will bring\u001b[30d"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[29dpride and honor to my name.\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.001, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[29dI will not let the enemy win, I will not die, and I will not let \u001b(B\u001b[0;1mThe Predator\u001b(B\u001b[m catch me...!\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[M\u001b[30;100H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1;5H\u001b[30m\u001b[47mMain Hallway Ring (I)           \u001b[1;84H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[30m\u001b[47m3\u001b[2;8H\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[32m\u001b[47mnorth\u001b[30m\u001b[47m   \u001b[32m\u001b[47meast\u001b[30m\u001b[47m   west   \u001b[32m\u001b[47msouthwest\r\u001b[30d\u001b[39;49m\u001b(B\u001b[m>\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
[4.812, "o", "\u001b[?25l"]
